<title>USA: Cable &amp; Co explains stock activity.</title>
<headline>Cable &amp; Co explains stock activity.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cable &amp; Co Worldwide said on Friday the recent drop in the stock price was the direct result of pressure on State Capital Markets, the firm which took the company public in June 1996.</p>
<p>The pressure is a  result of what has been described as illegal short selling on all of the firm's holdings, the shoe company said.</p>
<p>Cable &amp; Co's stock was trading up 5/16 at 3-5/8 in midday activity, just off its year low of 3-2/16.</p>
